frontend/src/lib/ui/README.md:3:Import components and public types from the `src/lib/ui/index.ts` barrel (for example `./lib/ui` from `src/Example.svelte`). Load `../lib/ui/styles.css` once in `src/routes/+layout.svelte`. It includes tokens, actions, patterns, focus rings, hidden captions, highlighted text and animation prerequisites. Field and Notice keep scoped styles. `/design-system` is the interactive reference in development only and requires no declarations API. Production returns 404 and hides its footer link.
