frontend/src/lib/ui/README.md:26:| Icon, IconIndicator                    | Canonical `IconName`; Icon is decorative. IconIndicator owns focus, pointer and Escape hints.                                                                                                                                        |
frontend/src/lib/ui/README.md:31:Tokens in [tokens.css](tokens.css) own colors, spacing, type and focus. Override `--accent` on a container for another palette, such as `var(--accent-funder)`. Result indicators, badges and highlights derive their colors from the local accent; a ResultRow root `class` can select that palette explicitly. `--focus-width` and `--focus-offset` apply at the root or on a container. Native links, buttons and summaries add one pixel to the offset. Do not import internal stylesheets individually.
